cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Fleet Policy Experimentation Framework"
abstract: >-
  An experimentation framework for evaluating fleet dispatch policies under
  matched stochastic conditions. The work combines empirically fitted
  Brooklyn demand and travel inputs, paired comparisons with predefined
  improvement and guardrail thresholds, and a mixed integer perfect
  information reference.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/gadient/experimentation-framework-fleet"
version: "0.0.1"
keywords:
  - exploratory data analysis
  - fleet operations
  - policy evaluation
  - stochastic experiments
  - electric vehicle charging
  - operations research
  - mixed-integer programming
  - design of experiments
authors:
  - name: "gadient"
